{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1439d884e51333a8d3435ae5c9fa69c5f3dfaea1289c1d653160505771947ef2","ja":"予定にない質問","zh":"计划外的提问","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cf56282abdf64d3c53860dcecd9f1326aec7eb3673d74f0ec83c8e9156db39f4","ja":"可憐と紗代子と亜利沙の3人は、\n生放送の番組に出演していて……","zh":"可怜、纱代子和亚利沙3人，\n正在参加直播节目的演出……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"864a0a07b6a5f1035b284163151d517dfedaffc6dba7fbb42962bb128dfaf7e5","ja":"「時間が余ったので、もう少し質問しちゃいますね」","zh":"“时间还富余，那我就再多问几个问题咯”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"45fffa6f0e6e21ea71dcdc50b027c8421715705696e3427971f80c18e078e852","ja":"「今後の『STARDOM ROAD』で\n楽しみにしてほしい所はどこでしょうか？」","zh":"“在今后的《STARDOM ROAD》中，\n最希望大家期待的地方是哪里呢？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4ce4041773b9b099f8d5b82402bd0b4a8eb6729faa8559a1c4339abce2263486","ja":"えっ、わ、私ですか！？　その、あの……\nす、すぐには、出てこなくて……。","zh":"诶，我、我吗！？那个，就是……\n一、一时半会儿，想不出来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"4e3c6b21bdcbfb56ddeee8b03bcd9e3973acc3e6f325a13521b361bd31d4e519","ja":"それはもちろん、今後の物語全てと\n登場人物達の成長や葛藤ですね！","zh":"那当然是今后故事的全部，\n以及登场人物们的成长与纠葛了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"bd36086877c23421f98ea2e11151049d8ddc3cc486a35f0074dc1f128c60f40a","ja":"これからきっと、みんながトップアイドルを目指して\n駆けあがっていく話になると思うんです！","zh":"今后一定会成为大家以顶尖偶像为目标，\n不断向上攀登的故事的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a4e73c0e26ccd50c9b02bf9a189a2a55399e63e056c54e7ebf715b213b3fe74c","ja":"それに、お互いの人間関係も目が離せなくって、\nそれがアイドル活動にも影響しちゃいそうで……。","zh":"而且，她们彼此的人际关系也让人移不开视线，\n感觉这还会影响到偶像活动……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e9dacfad854fc4949eca597c5e69e9ce54617237d1dfca42cbf71ae3279cb46a","ja":"……というセリフが伏線として回収されたり\nするのではと、予想しています！　あとは……。","zh":"我推测……这句台词可能会\n作为伏笔得到回收！另外还有……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"459651050d25a8ed7677dbc1906a4241dd4abf2c79c7c53de1334afd9681a4a5","ja":"「す、すみません。もうお時間です！　それでは、\n今日の放送はここまで！　また次回をお楽しみにー！」","zh":"“对、对不起。时间已经到了！那么，\n今天的广播就到这里！敬请期待下期节目～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"bea8f35b8c5218f8a2d6255449a7172d41b1ff15df2c9b69173f5f48daa4634a","ja":"うう～……。き、急な質問で、\nあ、焦って、ちゃんと回答できませんでした……。","zh":"呜呜～……提、提问太突然了，\n一、一慌张，就没能好好回答……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"07e51c4a21545f3d8da72f4e416e0aa065339f7828f5fb92076001987ed88d8f","ja":"本当にごめんなさい！　つい夢中になっちゃって……。\n亜利沙ちゃんも伝えたいこと、あったよね？","zh":"真的非常抱歉！一不小心就太投入了……。\n亚利沙也有想传达的事情，对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"fe1149248f13ffb8b5fdba1d4ed9300d4c72e6539e09eb9d3bfbe0c117f54c99","ja":"気にしないでください！　夢中で話す紗代子ちゃんを\n見れて、ありさは大・大・大満足ですから！","zh":"请别介意！能看到讲得那么入迷的纱代子，\n亚利沙已经超级、超级、超——满意了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"6223c3a7d69d064f13f6d34f3b91f04c967a6bdc794503c7d4c068f0092ae1c5","ja":"それに、失敗は誰にだってあります。\n次の機会に上手くできたらいいんです！","zh":"而且，谁都有失败的时候。\n下次有机会能做好就行了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"de1bbf93c33a33d4b2eaa82ef3ff57c7d5a4d492473eb2ea888c5930dee77629","ja":"で、でも……また、同じような失敗を\nしちゃうかもって、すごく不安で……。","zh":"可、可是……我又很担心，\n自己会不会再犯同样的错误……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"e29d776151dc82a901266e10d5bac4bce37d51369db557a7b923318af13af8cb","ja":"なるほど……\nそういうことでしたら、特訓をしましょう！","zh":"原来如此……\n既然是这样的话，那就来进行特训吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"9a57ef64de6e0912fdc4442626267586eb94fb8ec7575c342de4a8311e6c49aa","ja":"ええっ……！？　特訓！？","zh":"咦……！？特训！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"530652ad642b13603c2fa0947d251b9dc25e2d0b56a0f851f0f0e5ca8db750b6","ja":"今後、ありさが不意打ちでインタビューしますので、\nおふたりはそれにビシッと答えてください！","zh":"之后亚利沙会进行突击采访，\n请两位利落地回答哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"dc59af00207fe42e6e605749208da2428a26eb5c17671c9990bc8759745fb0ee","ja":"これを乗り越えればきっと、\n急な質問にも、しっかり答えられるようになりますよ！","zh":"只要跨过这道坎，\n面对突如其来的提问也一定能应对自如的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1442.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"7859156a29ef98a55fc91f88a4def32268ef5bd91cf0ee8f703b84ae0f747d94","ja":"なるほど……！\nわかったわ！　その特訓、ぜひ受けさせて！","zh":"原来如此……！\n我明白了！那项特训，请务必让我参加！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
